{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19919","headline":"秋怀 十四 · 孟郊","name":"秋怀 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄河倒上天，衆水有却来。\n人心不及水，一直去不回。\n一直亦有巧，不肯至蓬莱。\n一直不知疲，唯闻至省台。\n忍古不失古，失古志易摧。\n失古劒亦折，失古琴亦哀。\n夫子失古泪，当时落漼漼。\n诗老失古心，至今寒皑皑。\n古骨无浊肉，古衣如藓苔。\n劝君勉忍古，忍古销尘埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}